sca.check.rationale: Setting this parameter forces users to enter a password when authenticating with SSH.
sca.check.remediation: Edit the /etc/ssh/sshd_config file to set the IgnoreRhosts parameter to yes above any Include and Match entries as follows: IgnoreRhosts yes Note: First occurrence of a option takes precedence, Match set statements withstanding. If Include locations are enabled, used, and order of precedence is understood in your environment, the entry may be created in a file in Include location.
